    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/architect-designer/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Architect Designer Theme is an elegant, feature-rich solution tailored to meet the needs of architects, interior designers, and design professionals. Built for showcasing architectural rendering services, 3D modeling, building design portfolios, and interior or landscape projects, this theme provides an exceptional platform to display your expertise. Whether you specialize in residential architecture, commercial building design, urban regeneration, eco-friendly architecture, smart building solutions, hospitality design, educational facility architecture, or adaptive reuse projects, the theme’s clean, modern layout enhances your content’s visual appeal. Equipped with a powerful page builder plugin for easy customization of banners, layouts, colors, and typography without coding, it allows you to align your website with your unique brand identity. Perfect for sharing architectural sketches, walkthroughs, design consultations, or client presentations, it also supports immersive galleries, videos, and virtual tours to help clients visualize projects. With SEO-friendly coding, fast loading speed, and responsive design, your site performs seamlessly across all devices. From urban planning portfolios and public park architecture to museum or commercial project showcases, the Architect Designer Theme’s focus on clarity, sophistication, and innovative presentation tools ensures your work stands out online."
    },
